{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-serenity-lakes-5","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"serenity-lakes-5-gulf-land-property-developers-jvc-jumeirah-village-circle","about":"Serenity Lakes 5 is a modern project from the developer Gulf Land, located in the dynamic JVC area. The complex has 5 floors and offers studios and apartments from 1 to 3 bedrooms of different sizes, with balconies, large windows and fully equipped kitchens. Commercial facilities, including cafes and shops, will occupy the ground and first floors.For the convenience of residents, covered parking is provided with allocated spaces for each residential unit. The territory of the Serenity Lakes 5 complex will be landscaped and well-groomed, with the possibility of leaving it in just 4-5 minutes.The proximity to the Al Khail Rd highway provides excellent transport accessibility from anywhere in the city. The nearest public transport stop is JVC, Noor Residences - just 2 minutes away.For shopping, residents can visit VIVA Supermarket - JVC, located a 5-minute drive away. The complex is within a 25-minute drive from Dubai International Airport (DXB) and 35 minutes from Al Maktoum International Airport.Children of residents can attend JSS International School, which can be reached by car in 5 minutes. Dubai Sports City is a 10-minute drive away and offers a variety of sports facilities and sports events throughout the year.If necessary, medical care is available at Medical clinic Parkview Hospital, which is a 15-minute drive from the complex.","price":709644,"title":"Serenity Lakes 5","bitrix":{"id":720,"pf_id":"are.2.11621","source":null,"project_id":"Serenity Lakes 5","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Serenity Lakes 5","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Gulf Land Property Developers","project_location":"Jumeirah Village Circle"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/64